{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15293","headline":"杂歌呈郑锡司空文明 · 李端","name":"杂歌呈郑锡司空文明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨宵梦到亡何乡，忽见一人山之阳。\n高冠长剑立石堂，鬓眉飒爽瞳子方。\n胡麻作饭琼作浆，素书一帙在柏牀。\n啖我还丹拍我背，令我延年在人代。\n乃书数字与我持，小儿归去须读之。\n觉来知是虚无事，山中雪平云覆地。\n东岭啼猿三四声，卷帘一望心堪碎。\n蓬莱有梯不可蹑，向海回头泪盈睫。\n且闻童子是苍蝇，谁谓庄生异蝴蝶。\n学仙去来辞故人，长安道路多风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}